","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merach, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health, Google Fit, Fanton Fite (By Merach)<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}}},"block_order":["item_HxLrkL","item_FWiCMj","item_NnRWkE","item_77zXwN","item_YywGEt","item_AUKXdT","item_cmGzgG"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"center","subheading":"","title":"","content":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"accordion_content_ABVBL4":{"type":"accordion-content","blocks":{"item_VcpLPc":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Controls and Functions","content":"<ul><li><strong>Resistance System<\/strong>: Pure water resistance<\/li><li><strong>Resistance Levels<\/strong>: Maximum water level<\/li><li><strong>Resistance Adjustment<\/strong>: Water resistance - Adjust water volume<\/li><li><strong>Paddle Blades<\/strong>: 2 blades<\/li><li><strong>Water Tank Material<\/strong>: Polycarbonate<\/li><li><strong>Water Tank Capacity<\/strong>: Full - 14L<\/li><li><strong>Frame Material<\/strong>: Rubberwood + Steel<\/li><li><strong>Additional Features<\/strong>: Includes electric water pump and water filter<\/li><li><strong>Folding Mechanism<\/strong>: Track folding<\/li><li><strong>Power Supply<\/strong>: Battery<\/li><li><strong>Max Weight Capacity<\/strong>: 180 kg<\/li><li><strong>Handle Material<\/strong>: Foam<\/li><li><strong>Pull Rope Material<\/strong>: Nylon<\/li><li><strong>Handle Size<\/strong>: 435 mm<\/li><li><strong>Foot Pedal Adjustment<\/strong>: 6 adjustable lengths<\/li><li><strong>Foot Pedal Spacing<\/strong>: 30 mm<\/li><li><strong>Track Type<\/strong>: Dual rail<\/li><li><strong>Track Material<\/strong>: Rubberwood<\/li><li><strong>Sliding Rail Material<\/strong>: PVC<\/li><li><strong>Track Length<\/strong>: 900 mm<\/li><li><strong>Inner Gap Length<\/strong>: 1173 mm<\/li><li><strong>Track Incline<\/strong>: None<\/li><li><strong>Suitable Height<\/strong>: 3' 11\" - 6' 7\"<\/li><li><strong>Seat Material<\/strong>: PU foam (ergonomic)<\/li><li><strong>Seat Height from Floor<\/strong>: 220 mm<\/li><li><strong>Seat Roller Material<\/strong>: N\/A<\/li><li><strong>Display Type<\/strong>: LED Electronic Display<\/li><li><strong>Display Information<\/strong>: Time, Distance, Calories, T-CNT, CNT<\/li><li><strong>iPad Stand<\/strong>: √<\/li><li><strong>Heart Rate Monitoring<\/strong>: None<\/li><li><strong>Communication Method<\/strong>: Bluetooth<\/li><li><strong>Built-in Programs<\/strong>: None<\/li><li><strong>App<\/strong>: MERACH, Kinomap<\/li><li><strong>Courses<\/strong>: √<\/li><li><strong>Storage Method<\/strong>: Vertical foldable storage<\/li><li><strong>Space Occupied (m³)<\/strong>: 0.23<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"item_NhAFCk":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Machine Dimensions","content":"<ul><li><strong>Folding Size<\/strong>: 530 * 440 * 955 mm<\/li><li><strong>Unfolded Size<\/strong>: 1845 * 440 * 710 mm<\/li><li><strong>Packaging Size<\/strong>: 980 * 460 * 290 mm<\/li><li><strong>Net Weight<\/strong>: 16.5 kg<\/li><li><strong>Gross Weight<\/strong>: 23.3 kg<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"item_Nxwg4T":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Warranty","content":"<ul><li>Frame: 24 months<\/li><li>Motor: 24 months<\/li><li>Parts: 24 months<\/li><li>Wear Parts: 24 months<\/li><li>Decoration Parts: 90 days<\/li><li>Commercial Use: Not available, for private use only.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"item_Pgrxki":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Packliste","content":"<ul><li>Hauptrahmenmontage*1<\/li><li>Vordere FuBrohr*1<\/li><li>Kissen*1<\/li><li>Linkes Podal*1<\/li><li>Stutzrohrmontage*1<\/li><li>Glcitschienen-Baugruppe*1<\/li><li>Rechtes Pedal*1<\/li><li>Schrauben & Zubehör*1<\/li><li>Sitzkissenassemblage×1*1<\/li><li>Benutzerhandbuch*1<br\/><br\/>Bitte überprüfen Sie, dass jede Komponente und jedes Zubehörteil vor demZusammenbau vollstandig ist.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"item_KG8pzh":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Benutzerhandbuch","content":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0570\/8280\/6344\/files\/Q1S_Pro_2.0_Merach_Magnetisches_Rudergerat.pdf?v=1734510063\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0570\/8280\/6344\/files\/Q1S_Pro_2.0_Merach_Magnetisches_Rudergerat.pdf?v=1734510063\">Download-Anleitung &lt;&lt;<\/a><\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["item_VcpLPc","item_NhAFCk","item_Nxwg4T","item_Pgrxki","item_KG8pzh"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"Product Specification","content":"<p>Here are the product details. If you need further information, please do not hesitate to contact us.<br\/><br\/>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info.uk@merachfit.com\" title=\"mailto:info.uk@merachfit.com\">info.uk@merachfit.com<\/a><\/p>","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"start","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"faq_dPrky4":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_9JqcHd":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"1. Is the Merach R28R1 water rowing machine quiet enough for a flat?","content":"<p>Yes. Water rowers produce a gentle splashing sound when in use, which many people find soothing and natural. The Merach R28R1 remains quiet enough for home use, with noise levels mainly depending on rowing speed — the faster you row, the louder the water moves in the tank.<\/p>"}},"item_i6qDNP":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"2. How do I adjust the resistance on the Merach R28R1?","content":"<p>Resistance is created by the water in the tank. Rowing faster increases resistance, while rowing slower reduces it. You can also add or remove water to set your preferred intensity, making it suitable for light cardio sessions or more challenging workouts.<\/p>"}},"item_fyC8QA":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"3. Can the Merach R28R1 accommodate taller or heavier users?","content":"<p>Yes. The R28R1 has a robust solid wood frame and supports up to 180 kg. It’s suitable for users between 120 cm and 200 cm tall, giving a stable and secure rowing experience for a wide range of home users.<\/p>"}},"item_yR7Baj":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"4. Can the Merach R28R1 be stored easily in a small flat?","content":"<p>Absolutely. The rowing machine features a 180° foldable design, so it can be stored upright against a wall when not in use. Built-in transport wheels make it easy to move around your home, perfect for smaller spaces.<\/p>"}},"item_xQUGEV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"5. Can I connect the Merach R28R1 to apps?","content":"<p>Yes. The machine has Bluetooth connectivity, allowing you to sync workout data with your phone or tablet. It works with popular apps like MERACH, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health and Google Fit, so you can track your progress and make workouts more engaging.<\/p>"}},"item_HkfhHn":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"6. Is the Merach R28R1 easy to assemble and maintain?","content":"<p>Yes. Assembly is straightforward. Once built, simply fill the water tank to create resistance. Maintenance is minimal — clean the tank occasionally and check water levels, and the machine will stay reliable for years of home training.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_9JqcHd","item_i6qDNP","item_fyC8QA","item_yR7Baj","item_xQUGEV","item_HkfhHn"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"","answer_time":"","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"specific